{14}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{15}{As you're doubtlessly aware, Tarant and much of the unified Kingdom is dependent upon Caladonian farming for grain and other food products.  Because of this, our farmers make a very nice living, and our economy is very stable.  Our food export taxes and tariffs bring in a considerable amount of money.  We need to make sure this continues to be the case...}{As you're doubtlessly aware, Tarant and much of the unified Kingdom is dependent upon Caladonian farming for grain and other food products.  Because of this, our farmers make a very nice living, and our economy is very stable.  Our food export taxes and tariffs bring in a considerable amount of money.  We need to make sure this continues to be the case...}{}{}{}{gf2247 1}
