{18}{If you can assure that the grain taxes will be kept in place, even after membership, then I'm sure we can find a payment that is suitable for the service.  Shall we call it, say, 600 gold pieces?}{If you can assure that the grain taxes will be kept in place, even after membership, then I'm sure we can find a payment that is suitable for the service.  Shall we call it, say, 600 gold pieces?}{}{}{}{}
